# Internal service hostnames. All of these route through Traefik (K3s's
# bundled ingress controller, listening on :80 on every node) to the
# matching in-cluster Service - no port needed in any of these URLs.
192.168.1.253 api.home
192.168.1.253 ai.home
192.168.1.253 grafana.home
192.168.1.253 argocd.home
192.168.1.253 dashboard.home
192.168.1.253 alerts.home
192.168.1.253 prometheus.home
192.168.1.253 chat.home
192.168.1.253 wikipedia.home
# Not behind Traefik: the phone bridge runs on the Pi's host (it needs the
# Bluetooth radio), serving its own TLS on :8443 - https://phone.home:8443.
# See docs/phone.md.
192.168.1.253 phone.home
